# Dining table (issue 034, 047): the teal microwave with its pile of mail at the west end (as in the photos), bean jar, walnut box, grinder, kettle, and at the east end a white dripper cone over a mug on its black scale with a red light. 4x2 tiles. Issue 065: no plate here (the plate is the `table-plate` variant); a mug stands on the bare wood instead.
size: 64x32
